				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				564,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Restore missing closing parenthesis in codegen schema formatter\n\nThe prior `)` → `;` bulk statement-termination refactor stripped the closing `)` from the `.join()` call in `FormatDocComment`, leaving a malformed chained method expression in the codegen emit schema.\n\nAdd the missing `)` before `;` to restore valid TypeScript syntax for the array join expression that builds JSDoc body lines. This is a pure syntax fix with no behavioral change.",
			"SHA": "67ac5bd1d6decfd4dbf32da80cbb1d08423dc377"
